      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27529_kaabu_ex5",
      "japanese": "{打者|だしゃ}はカーブを{見送|みおく}った。",
      "english": "The batter let the curveball go by.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27529_kaabu_ex6",
      "japanese": "{二|に}ストライクから{投|な}げたカーブで{三振|さんしん}に{打|う}ち{取|と}った。",
      "english": "With a curveball thrown on the two-strike count, he struck the batter out.",
      "sense_numbers": [
